{"path":"numeric/math/cosh","title":"cosh, coshf, coshl","titleHtml":"cosh, coshf, coshl","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/math/cosh","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"If a range error due to overflow occurs, +HUGE_VAL, +HUGE_VALF, or +HUGE_VALL is returned.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math\"><code>&lt;math.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; coshf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">float</span> arg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> arg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> coshl<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> arg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/tgmath\"><code>&lt;tgmath.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define cosh( arg )</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> Computes the hyperbolic cosine of <code>arg</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Type-generic macro: If the argument has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span></code>, <code>coshl</code> is called. Otherwise, if the argument has integer type or the type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span></code>, <code>cosh</code> is called. Otherwise, <code>coshf</code> is called. If the argument is complex, then the macro invokes the corresponding complex function (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ccosh\"><span class=\"kw808\">ccoshf</span></a></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ccosh\"><span class=\"kw807\">ccosh</span></a></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ccosh\"><span class=\"kw809\">ccoshl</span></a></span></code>).</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> arg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> floating-point value representing a hyperbolic angle\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\nIf no errors occur, the hyperbolic cosine of <code>arg</code> (<span class=\"texhtml\">cosh(arg)</span>, or <span class=\"texhtml\"><span class=\"t-mfrac\"><table><tr><td>e<span class=\"t-su\">arg<br></span>+e<span class=\"t-su\">-arg<br></span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span></span>) is returned.\n<p>If a range error due to overflow occurs, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/HUGE_VAL\">+HUGE_VAL</a></span>, <code>+HUGE_VALF</code>, or <code>+HUGE_VALL</code> is returned.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Error_handling\">Error handling</h3>\n<p>Errors are reported as specified in <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/math_errhandling\"><code>math_errhandling</code></a>.\n</p><p>If the implementation supports IEEE floating-point arithmetic (IEC 60559),\n</p>\n<ul><li> if the argument is ±0, 1 is returned\n</li><li> If the argument is ±∞, +∞ is returned\n</li><li> if the argument is NaN, NaN is returned\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>For the IEEE-compatible type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span></code>, if <span class=\"texhtml\">|arg| &gt; 710.5</span>, then <code>cosh(arg)</code> overflows.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;errno.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fenv.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;math.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">// #pragma STDC FENV_ACCESS ON</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"cosh(1) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>cosh(-1)=&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"log(sinh(1) + cosh(1))=%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/log\"><span class=\"kw660\">log</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/sinh\"><span class=\"kw676\">sinh</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// special values</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"cosh(+0) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>cosh(-0) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// error handling</span>\n    <span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/feclearexcept\"><span class=\"kw717\">feclearexcept</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw728\">FE_ALL_EXCEPT</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"cosh(710.5) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">710.5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/c/error/errno_macros\"><span class=\"kw478\">ERANGE</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw878\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"    errno == ERANGE\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/fetestexcept\"><span class=\"kw718\">fetestexcept</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw732\">FE_OVERFLOW</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw835\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"    FE_OVERFLOW raised\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>cosh(1) = 1.543081\ncosh(-1)= 1.543081\nlog(sinh(1) + cosh(1))=1.000000\ncosh(+0) = 1.000000\ncosh(-0) = 1.000000\ncosh(710.5) = inf\n    errno == ERANGE: Numerical result out of range\n    FE_OVERFLOW raised</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.5.4 The cosh functions (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.2.4 The cosh functions (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.5.4 The cosh functions (p: 176)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 272-273)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.2.4 The cosh functions (p: 379)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.5.4 The cosh functions (p: 241)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 373-375)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.2.4 The cosh functions (p: 520)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.5.4 The cosh functions (p: 222)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 335-337)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.9.2.4 The cosh functions (p: 457)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c89\">\n<ul><li> C89/C90 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1990): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 4.5.3.1 The cosh function \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/sinh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sinh</span><span>sinhf</span><span>sinhl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes hyperbolic sine (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\sinh{x} }\">sinh(x)</span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/tanh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tanh</span><span>tanhf</span><span>tanhl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes hyperbolic tangent (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\tanh{x} }\">tanh(x)</span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/acosh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>acosh</span><span>acoshf</span><span>acoshl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes inverse hyperbolic cosine (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\operatorname{arcosh}{x} }\">arcosh(x)</span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ccosh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ccosh</span><span>ccoshf</span><span>ccoshl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes the complex hyperbolic cosine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>cosh</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Error handling","id":"Error_handling"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"},{"path":"numeric/math","title":"Common mathematical functions"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"cosh, coshf, coshl","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Computes the hyperbolic cosine of arg."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"arg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If no errors occur, the hyperbolic cosine of"},{"label":"Error handling","note":"Errors are reported as specified in math_errhandling."},{"label":"Notes","note":"For the IEEE-compatible type double, if |arg| > 710.5, then cosh(arg) overflows."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sinh, sinhf, sinhl","note":"computes hyperbolic sine (sinh(x))"},{"label":"tanh, tanhf, tanhl","note":"computes hyperbolic tangent (tanh(x))"},{"label":"acosh, acoshf, acoshl","note":"computes inverse hyperbolic cosine (arcosh(x))"},{"label":"ccosh, ccoshf, ccoshl","note":"computes the complex hyperbolic cosine"}]}]},"standards":["C99"],"wordCount":409,"codeBlockCount":2}
